maludb for Debian / Ubuntu
==========================

Two binary packages are produced from this source:

  postgresql-18-maludb-core
      The PGXS extension. Installs:
        /usr/lib/postgresql/18/lib/maludb_core.so
        /usr/share/postgresql/18/extension/maludb_core.control
        /usr/share/postgresql/18/extension/maludb_core--*.sql

      After install, run inside a database where you want MaluDB:
          sudo -u postgres psql -d <db> -c \
              'CREATE EXTENSION maludb_core CASCADE;'

      The CASCADE pulls in vector (pgvector) automatically.

  maludb-mc2dbd
      The MC2DB listener daemon. Installs:
        /usr/sbin/maludb_mc2dbd
        /etc/maludb/maludb-mc2dbd.conf
        /lib/systemd/system/maludb-mc2dbd.service
        /usr/share/maludb/scripts/maludb-validate

      The service is NOT auto-enabled. Wire credentials, optional
      bearer token, and (for production) a real TLS cert into
      /etc/maludb/maludb-mc2dbd.conf, then:
          sudo systemctl enable --now maludb-mc2dbd
          maludb-validate          # post-install acceptance check

Building from source
====================

This is a native package (debian/source/format = 3.0 native). The
authoritative dev/build host is Ubuntu 26.04 (resolute) with PGDG
PostgreSQL 18. On a fresh Ubuntu 26.04 with the PGDG repo configured:

    sudo apt-get install -y \
        debhelper devscripts postgresql-server-dev-18 \
        postgresql-server-dev-all postgresql-18-pgvector \
        libpq-dev libmicrohttpd-dev libjansson-dev libgnutls28-dev \
        libcurl4-openssl-dev pkg-config

    cd maludb-core-26
    dpkg-buildpackage -b -us -uc

The .deb files appear in the parent directory.

Multi-PG-version
================

This line of the package targets PostgreSQL 18 on Ubuntu 26.04 only
(debian/pgversions = 18). The Ubuntu 24.04 / PostgreSQL 17 line lives in
https://github.com/maludb/maludb-core. To build for an additional major:
  - Add postgresql-server-dev-NN to Build-Depends in debian/control.
  - Add NN to debian/pgversions.
  - Add a postgresql-NN-maludb-core binary package stanza plus matching
    .install / .postinst files.
